{"id":"n37276-1-8","stage":5,"title":"군중 · 群众","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37276-1-8-1","ko":"저 광장에 있는 군중들 좀 봐.","zh":"快看那个广场上的人群啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"광장에","meaning":"广场","explanation":"광장：广场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"광장","audio":"/audio/afbb411c2c9e3884febd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24004","senseId":"1","lemma":"광장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"군중들","meaning":"群众","explanation":"군중：群众；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"군중","audio":"/audio/e538b560f365d3962867.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37276","senseId":"1","lemma":"군중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"afbb411c2c9e3884","term":"광장","zh":"广场","audio":"/audio/afbb411c2c9e3884febd.mp3","entryId":"24004","definition":"位于城市中央，有很多人聚集的宽敞的地方。","pronunciation":["광ː장"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"e538b560f365d396","term":"군중","zh":"群众","audio":"/audio/e538b560f365d3962867.mp3","entryId":"37276","definition":"聚集在一处的很多人。","pronunciation":["군중"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8c118ae3f7e60cbe8750.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37276-1-8-2","ko":"사람이 엄청 많다. 오늘 무슨 행사가 있나?","zh":"人真的好多啊。今天有什么活动吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많다.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행사가","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4134de7478047b73e3b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.43,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37276","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["人真的好多啊。今天有什么活动吗？","快看那个广场上的人